From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:16:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 22/42] bitproxy: server switcher on the dashboard

Dashboard card listing the imported servers with their latency from
sing-box's URL test ('85 ms', or 'No response' in red when a server is
down). A test runs when the card opens with the VPN on, plus a refresh
button; no background testing. Tapping a server switches to it (save +
re-apply). The group subscription only runs while the card is shown.
